message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Intelligent-Social-AR: A Mixed-Reality Testbed for Studying Augmented Focus Group Moderation"
abstract: >-
  A Unity testbed for Meta Quest mixed reality in which a human moderator
  runs a simulated focus group with four scripted, embodied virtual agents.
  It implements a 2x2 within-subjects study (AR augmentations present or
  absent, crossed with a traditional table or an opinion-grid seating
  method), with counterbalanced condition order, fixed avatar teams,
  local neural text-to-speech, and head-gaze logging.
